      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"75\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quiz: Adoptive Succession, Broken</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"160\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nerva</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">adopts heir</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"160\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Trajan</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">adopts heir</text><rect x=\"520\" y=\"160\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"620\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hadrian</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">adopts heir</text><rect x=\"740\" y=\"160\" width=\"260\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"870\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Antoninus Pius</text><text x=\"870\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">adopts Marcus</text><line x=\"550\" y=\"320\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"420\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"440\" width=\"440\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#ef4444\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"490\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Marcus Aurelius</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"525\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">breaks the pattern:</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"555\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">names biological son Commodus</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"660\" width=\"600\" height=\"130\" fill=\"#ffd700\" opacity=\"0.15\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Correct answer: A</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"745\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Four adoptive successions, then one biological choice</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Marcus's succession decision broke a pattern of adoptive succession that had produced four capable emperors before him."
